        <item>
            <title>0.15.21</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 11:25:49 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>182</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.21</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Screen video from a recording interrupted by a crash, a forced quit, or an app update is no longer lost. The video is now written in a crash-safe form and is recovered on the next launch alongside the audio (up to the last few seconds before the interruption), instead of the interrupted file being unplayable. Only relevant when Screen video recording is enabled.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
